[en.CHARACTER_AQUAMARINE_NAME]
Aquamarine

[en.CHARACTER_AQUAMARINE_DESC]
Dear friend of the Blossom Burst and Chanteuse, once a drama actor. After the “Silence” ended, she starred in the musical “The Phantom of the Opera” written by Autumn Blaze. Later, Aquamarine became the District Governor of Eastern Regions, promoting the construction of Fluttershy Harbour. After the establishment of Fluttershy Harbour, the quality of life of the Kirins in the Eastern Regions significantly improved and attracted many immigrants. In just a few years, the number of Kirins in the Eastern Regions has nearly doubled.

[zh.CHARACTER_AQUAMARINE_NAME]
海蓝

[zh.CHARACTER_AQUAMARINE_DESC]
繁花与歌伶的挚友，曾为戏剧演员。“静默”结束后，她出演了秋烨编剧的音乐剧《歌剧魅影》。后来，海蓝成为了东部地区区长，推动了柔柔港的建设。柔柔港设立后，东部地区麒麟生活质量显著提高，吸引了许多移民。短短几年间，东部地区的麒麟数量几乎翻了一倍。
